// Brush sizes are clamped per item: an iron beam brush asked for radius 9 places a radius-2 disc
// (its max), a wood pillar brush asked for 0.1 places a single cell (its min), and a pickaxe asked
// for 9 digs a radius-3 bite (29 cells), not a crater.
map
#####################################
#...................dddddddddddddd###
#...................dddddddddddddd###
#...................dddddddddddddd###
#...................dddddddddddddd###
#...................dddddddddddddd###
#...................dddddddddddddd###
#...................dddddddddddddd###
#.....@.............dddddddddddddd###
#####################################
end
give IronBeam 40
give WoodPillar 40
brush 1 9
place 2 -3 0 IronBeam
expect 3 static:IronBeam == 9
brush 4 0.1
place 5 3 0 WoodPillar
expect 6 static:WoodBeam == 1
expect 6 is:3,-1,WoodBeam == 0
// dig: pickaxe, asked radius 9 -> 3 (29 cells of dirt)
tool 10 1
brush 10 9
mine 10-20 17 -4
expect 20 count:Dirt == 83        // 112 - 29
